# Recorded input for the text field page (widgets/textfield.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 140 in the
# default theme: the Name field (empty, placeholder "Your name") at x 12..308, y 38..63, and the
# City field ("Oslo") at x 12..308, y 97..122; text starts 8 px in, 8.4 px per byte. One line per
# frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40, Backspace 42, Home 74, Left 80.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 140
dt 0.016
pointer 300 135
# 1: press Name: focused, caret at its start
frame
pointer 100 50
buttons left
# 2: release, type
frame
buttons
text Ada Lovelace
# 3: Shift+Home selects it all
frame
press 74 shift
# 4: typing replaces the selection
frame
text Grace
# 5: Left twice
frame
press 80
press 80
# 6: Enter submits (and inserts nothing)
frame
press 40
# 7: press City after "Os": focus moves, caret at 2
frame
pointer 37 110
buttons left
# 8: drag after "Oslo": "lo" selected
frame
pointer 54 110
# 9: release, Backspace deletes the selection
frame
buttons
press 42
# 10: type
frame
text aka
